// Declaration-only build of the reusable read layer (README §11).
//
// The main `tsconfig.json` is `noEmit` — this Worker is bundled by wrangler and
// never runs `tsc` output — and a consumer importing the TypeScript source
// directly does not need this either. It exists for a consumer that cannot read
// the `.ts` (a JavaScript Worker, a different toolchain), so it can still see the
// query layer's types.
//
// Emits `.d.ts` only. There is deliberately no `.js` output: a compiled copy of
// the queries is a second implementation that can lag behind this one, which is
// the exact failure the shared lib exists to prevent.
{
  "extends": "./tsconfig.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "noEmit": false,
    "declaration": true,
    "declarationMap": true,
    "emitDeclarationOnly": true,
    "outDir": "dist/types",
    "rootDir": "src"
  },
  "include": ["src/**/*.ts"]
}
